    <string name="settings_support_micro_payment_index_description">Per Shaparak POS receipt regulations (general provisions, items 1–5), for successful transactions above the micro-payment index (above 5,000,000 Rials), providing a paper receipt to the customer is mandatory.\n\nFor successful transactions at or below the micro-payment index, providing a paper receipt is at the customer\'s discretion. Payment service providers must design their POS menus so that after the transaction and digital receipt, the customer can choose whether to receive a paper receipt.\n\nThe micro-payment index is at most equal to the Shetab ATM cash withdrawal limit, updated by the Central Bank.</string>
